    <generalInfo>
      <description>Minimal, hand-authored reproduction of a real CCEL Calvin
ThML nesting pattern (confirmed against calcom05.xml, "Harmony of the Law,
Volume 3", div "ii.i.iv"): a table-less div2[type=scripture] wraps a real
div3[type=scripture] directly (already handled by the combined-volume
fix), but ELSEWHERE in the same volume a table-less div2 wraps a
table-less div3[type=section] ("Supplements to the Commandment"-style
grouping) which itself wraps several div4[type=scripture] siblings that
carry the real table + commentary -- one level deeper than the
combined-volume fix's original single-level unwrap handled, confirmed to
silently drop 78 sections / ~392K characters of real Calvin commentary
before the 2026-09-04 generic hierarchical-traversal fix.</description>
